[b]重要提示：涉及存档操作，请妥善备份好存档。[/b]
[b]IMPORTANT: This mod affects saves. Back up your save files before use.[/b]

[size=5][b]500 Manual Save Slots[/b][/size]
Raise the normal manual save limit in Phantom Blade Zero from [b]20 to 500[/b]. Keep more progress milestones and continue using the game's familiar save and load menus.

[b]Features[/b]
• Create new manual saves beyond the original 20-slot limit.
• The manual save counter displays /500.
• Loads automatically when you start the game with PBZModLoader.
• Lightweight JavaScript mod; no separate launcher, Node.js or Python needed.

[b]Tested in game with 27 manual saves working normally.[/b]

[b]Installation[/b]
1. Close the game and back up the entire save folder: ProjectPBZ/Saved/SaveGames/Steam/<account folder>/.
2. Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/phantombladezero/mods/113]PBZModLoader[/url] following its guide. The loader is required and downloaded separately.
3. Extract this mod's ZIP into the game folder containing ProjectPBZ.
4. Confirm the file is at ProjectPBZ/PBZModLoader/mods/PBZManualSave500/main.js, then start the game normally.

Open the normal manual save menu at a bell. The counter should show /500.

[b]How it works[/b]
The mod sets the manual save capacity helper to 500. The game still handles the actual save count, slot names, writing and loading. Automatic saves and Nightmare run slots keep their original behaviour.

[b]Update or remove[/b]
Close the game and replace or remove only ProjectPBZ/PBZModLoader/mods/PBZManualSave500/. Restart after any change. Removing the mod does not delete your save files; back up before removing it.

[b]中文说明[/b]
把普通手动存档上限从 [b]20 提升到 500[/b]，保留更多进度节点。已在游戏内实测 27 个手动存档正常使用。
安装 PBZModLoader 后，将本 Mod 解压到游戏根目录。确认 main.js 位于 ProjectPBZ/PBZModLoader/mods/PBZManualSave500/，以后正常启动游戏即可自动加载。自动存档和极难周目专用槽沿用游戏原有机制。
卸载前先备份，退出游戏后移除 PBZManualSave500 文件夹并重启。压缩包附有完整中英文说明。

